with friends and have a good social time."},{"business_id":"luwB0KsvoiXUewBvRdcYiA","review_id":"xbUueBnRZHP7DAdw0LY8Tw","date":"2019-07-08T19:16:02","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9155709147453308,"text_excerpt":"Stopped by this place on the way home, and its so incredibly beautiful inside. In addition to all the furniture being brand new, the layout and spacing is perfect. It was cool to see the community room with a sink, although I'm not entirely sure how to reserve or use it. The staff was super friendly and my drink came out fast. Definitely try the Nitro Cold Brew if you get a chance. Not sure if it will be a regular order of mine, but it was cool to try. There is also plenty of outdoor seating and a drive-thru, so I will definitely be back."},{"business_id":"luwB0KsvoiXUewBvRdcYiA","review_id":"Zma4p1DrEoGGns08k82pYg","date":"2019-07-01T21:22:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9006792306900024,"text_excerpt":"It's new and so are all the baristas. But they are super nice. And I can tell they actually hired some people from the neighborhood. That made me smile. Psalm, is my fav. The artwork by B Mike is also a plus. If I ever have a reason to sit in inside I'll grab a seat by the window and gawk at that."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"luwB0KsvoiXUewBvRdcYiA","photo_id":"EFxPdZqxIDP1vuYxt9TyNw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/EFxPdZqxIDP1vuYxt9TyNw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9618978500366211},{"business_id":"luwB0KsvoiXUewBvRdcYiA","photo_id":"SkwEmEULbqwXUP1-oOaCYQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/SkwEmEULbqwXUP1-oOaCYQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9433711171150208},{"business_id":"luwB0KsvoiXUewBvRdcYiA","photo_id":"-a-ndJeZMgssCp_p0eDzsQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-a-ndJeZMgssCp_p0eDzsQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9088689684867859}]},"notebook_case":null}
